          "toolCallRounds": [
            {
              "response": "```python\n# Load the generated CSV and modify it\ndf_bom = pd.read_csv(\"output/kitset_components.csv\")\n\n# Create a modified dataframe\nmodified_rows = []\n\n# Group by Product and BoM Type\ngrouped = df_bom.groupby(['Product', 'BoM Type'])\n\nfor (product, bom_type), group in grouped:\n    # First row keeps the Product and BoM Type\n    first_row = group.iloc[0].copy()\n    modified_rows.append(first_row)\n    \n    # Subsequent rows have empty Product and BoM Type\n    for idx in range(1, len(group)):\n        row = group.iloc[idx].copy()\n        row['Product'] = ''\n        row['BoM Type'] = ''\n        modified_rows.append(row)\n\n# Create new dataframe and save\ndf_modified = pd.DataFrame(modified_rows)\ndf_modified.to_csv(\"output/kitset_components.csv\", index=False)\nprint(f\"Modified {len(df_modified)} BoM rows\")\n```",
